{"title":"2018 AMC 10A Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solutions\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solutions</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/7/9f7f4de02215a8c5319886c13b2e291811346e1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$50\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Jacqueline, and Alice has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Jacqueline. What is the relationship between the amounts of soda that Liliane and Alice have?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/7/e8738bbc91069d2db6a97b6ab9b1e13052ac4606.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> more soda than Alice.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/0/6/506e909041d36bd739c8c959d341fcfbba3e9ad7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(B) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/6/6/96633b73a86b9d9110e1ff824fce08def96ca296.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Alice.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/b/0ab3a9c13a5c376b1660f46d00b9007dbae240cb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(C) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"27\" height=\"17\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/0/8/00890d0beefe80ec2a7d63ca91aaa8b8056ba355.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Alice.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/8/3787f1b7ce783a57c3a0d02ca4d485ccc950ff0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(D) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"28\" height=\"17\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/2/e126f0d41c904d37ba2c332347a24b75d4ac3066.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$75\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"32\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Alice.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/d/81d05263c2e18459105296c8e3e06c9fddddb735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(E) }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"17\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/b/71bd818354ff89f378b1c6b3d4df72f3c8c508b3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"41\" height=\"14\" /> more soda than Alice.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let's assume that Jacqueline has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gallon(s) of soda. Then Alice has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/7/d/b7d3560fba12b97d35543b1e1028c14f5f1545b2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"31\" height=\"13\" /> gallons and Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/7/15788e198a53ced87268aea78fcde68a84de92c0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"25\" height=\"14\" /> gallons. Doing division, we find out that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811dd7bc449eec57f31f8abab00b3d7b760234f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.5}{1.25}=1.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" />, which means that Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> more soda. Therefore, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>WLOG, lets use <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/c/c7cab1a05e1e0c1d51a6a219d96577a16b7abf9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gallons instead of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. When you work it out, you get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/1/601a7806cbfad68196c43a4665871f8c3186802e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gallons and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> gallons. We have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/1/c21a49745a84d560c817999141e2335dfa0cf9d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6 - 5 = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"72\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/0/79069377f91364c2f87a64e5f9f562a091c8a6c1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, we reach <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~Ezraft\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If Jacqueline has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> gallons of soda, Alice has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/9/659ea026f238eb026d79c0605eff5b2a20c01900.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.25x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"42\" height=\"13\" /> gallons, and Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/0/4/70426e82add219c57d25b20bc2966f9f1588a222.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1.5x$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"33\" height=\"13\" /> gallons. Thus, the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/1/811dd7bc449eec57f31f8abab00b3d7b760234f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1.5}{1.25}=1.2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"83\" height=\"38\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/3/8d3b814b941fac726e7472d4a819780836be4f57.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=&gt;$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"27\" height=\"10\" /> Liliane has <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/1/8/1183a12017e48198b3352789cc39b223b17945d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"35\" height=\"16\" /> more soda. Our answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/5/e/35e8ea2d16518197b5113002b8c0c7da6c311a3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(A)}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"41\" height=\"28\" />.\n</p><p>~lakecomo224 (minor edits made by &lt;B+)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/zMeYuDelX8E\">https://youtu.be/zMeYuDelX8E</a>\n</p><p>Education, the Study of Everything\n</p><p><br />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solutions\">Video Solutions</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solutions\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/vO-ELYmgRI8\">https://youtu.be/vO-ELYmgRI8</a>\n</p><p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/jx9RnjX9g-Q\">https://youtu.be/jx9RnjX9g-Q</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_AMC_10A_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style